        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          277 Tiangkaa Khwan Chu Zaic Pwni the",
            "                            8.8.8.8.Ref. 8. 8. 8.9",
            "          Doh hei Gb",
            "",
            "          1. Tiangkaa khwan chu zaic pwni the;",
            "             Kaipouc chaengmun khou ding bam the.",
            "             Tingkauh baanch'raa aching ching rui,",
            "             Lu thanh suan e, Hallelujah!",
            "",
            "                       Ai zaengsw ni tingkauh ramc khou;",
            "                       Gay liangpui neic Jisu how ni;",
            "                       Tingkauhmei guay lev lu suanna,",
            "                       Tingsaeng zaengna thuancna bam ni the.",
            "",
            "          2. 'Dih ryanraa ramc hei 'patlouna,",
            "             Zingbangc kalaan Pou' Jisu rui",
            "             Gaancna bammei ramc tingkauh khou.",
            "             Neih riw kage maek heic khoutei.",
            "",
            "          3. Saa ngam thuy lak ge karamgai;",
            "             Eden mwnpic khou lwmmei guay,",
            "             Neihlaana ruantat 'chamc ni the.",
            "             Siimei nai dat mak heic khoutei.",
            "",
            "          4. Chwnsi mikdui luanghmei guay tei,",
            "             Khrista baanc rui thutphuilou ni.",
            "             Tingkauh ramc khou theic dat lak khe;",
            "             Mikdui luanghmei nai dat lak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
